### Authorize a credit transaction
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions/8e8ae808-b154-48b5-9f3e-553935cc4543
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "account_id": "5b19c8b6-8cc4-4c72-8989-8c2ce15fa975",
  "type": "CREDIT",
  "amount": {
    "value": 97.07,
    "currency": "BRL"
  }
}

### Authorize a debit transaction
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions/7d1c9a5e-8b1b-4b8e-9e2b-2b2e7b4b9a11
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "account_id": "5b19c8b6-8cc4-4c72-8989-8c2ce15fa975",
  "type": "DEBIT",
  "amount": {
    "value": 20.00,
    "currency": "BRL"
  }
}

### Replaying the same transactionId returns the already persisted result
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions/8e8ae808-b154-48b5-9f3e-553935cc4543
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "account_id": "5b19c8b6-8cc4-4c72-8989-8c2ce15fa975",
  "type": "CREDIT",
  "amount": {
    "value": 97.07,
    "currency": "BRL"
  }
}

### Invalid transaction type should respond with a JSON 400 error
POST http://localhost:8080/transactions/9f2c9a5e-8b1b-4b8e-9e2b-2b2e7b4b9a22
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "account_id": "5b19c8b6-8cc4-4c72-8989-8c2ce15fa975",
  "type": "INVALID",
  "amount": {
    "value": 20.00,
    "currency": "BRL"
  }
}
